entum, applies the Drag patch’s logical bounds, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"pulses Reset when both position axes are within the placed graph’s 100-point center"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tolerance."}],"title":"Interaction_DragView","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview"}}}